{
  "title": { "zh": "停不下来的搜索" },
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "安比博年长，博比茜年长，所以安比茜年长；茜比安年长，却无论如何推不出来。证不出时，证明助手也必须停下，报告失败。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "s-loop",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "rules": {
        "trans": {
          "name": { "zh": "年纪大可以传下去" },
          "premises": ["Older(?x, ?y)", "Older(?y, ?z)"],
          "conclusion": "Older(?x, ?z)"
        }
      },
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Older(i, k)", "hyps": ["Older(i, j)", "Older(j, k)"] },
        { "goal": "Older(j, l)", "hyps": ["Older(j, k)", "Older(k, l)"] },
        { "goal": "Older(k, i)", "hyps": ["Older(i, j)", "Older(j, k)"], "want": "fails" }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手：证得出的目标证完，证不出的报告失败。"
      },
      "hint": [
        { "zh": "证不出的那一句，搜索在哪里停不下来？" },
        {
          "zh": "每一步都出现新的 ?，搜索看不出自己在绕圈。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "c0 = search[depth=\"3\"](in, body: c1) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c1 = append(c0.body, first: c2, second: c3) {",
        "      first {",
        "        c2 = assumption(c1.first)",
        "      }",
        "      second {",
        "        c3r0 = trans()",
        "        c3 = rule(c1.second, c3r0)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c0"
      ],
      "naive": [
        "c0 = search(in, body: c1) {",
        "  body {",
        "    c1 = append(c0.body, first: c2, second: c3) {",
        "      first {",
        "        c2 = assumption(c1.first)",
        "      }",
        "      second {",
        "        c3r0 = trans()",
        "        c3 = rule(c1.second, c3r0)",
        "      }",
        "    }",
        "  }",
        "}",
        "out <- c0"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
